  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.19: Run whole-repository and host-review queries without a local checkout through one shared --repo input across scan, estimate, explain, review packet, and review query, including immutable selected-source queries. Keep network access gated by --fetch-missing and preserve warm offline reuse with content-evidence and estimate parity for byte-equivalent trees. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.19/CHANGELOG.md",
